msgid "Wrapper"
msgstr "包装器"

msgid "Godot builds a standalone *_wrapper.tscn (baked scene). User edits live in the wrapper and propagate into combined-assets/levels."
msgstr "Godot 会构建一个独立的 *_wrapper.tscn（烘焙后的场景）。用户在包装器中进行编辑，并将更改传播到 combined-assets/levels 目录中。"

msgid "Inherited"
msgstr "继承"

msgid "Godot builds an *_inherited.tscn that inherits the glTF structure. User edits are local overrides on top of the imported glTF."
msgstr "Godot 会构建一个 *_inherited.tscn，该文件继承 glTF 结构。用户的编辑是在导入的 glTF 之上的局部覆盖。"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "禁用"

msgid "Godot does not auto-build a derived *_wrapper.tscn or *_inherited.tscn."
msgstr "Godot 不会自动构建派生的 *_wrapper.tscn 或 *_inherited.tscn。"

msgid "Target Path Organization:"
msgstr "目标路径组织:"

