msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Revert Project Settings"
msgstr "重置项目设置"

msgid "Project settings reset to factory defaults."
msgstr "将项目设置重置为出厂默认值。"

msgid "Organizer only. Children may export; no extra Godot folder is created."
msgstr "仅用于组织器。子项可以导出；不会创建额外的 Godot 文件夹。"

msgid "Exclude"
msgstr "排除"

msgid "This collection and its entire subtree are excluded from export."
msgstr "此集合及其整个子树将从导出中排除。"

msgid "Folder"
msgstr "文件夹"

msgid "Creates a Godot folder for organization. No glTF export."
msgstr "创建一个用于组织的 Godot 文件夹。不导出 glTF。"

msgid "Export as a standalone asset scene (e.g., a prop)."
msgstr "导出为独立资产场景（例如，一个道具）。"

msgid "Animation Library"
msgstr "动画库"

msgid "Exports only animation data, targeting another asset."
msgstr "仅导出动画数据，针对另一个资产。"

msgid "Skeletal Asset"
msgstr "骨骼资产"

msgid "Exports an asset with an Armature/Skeleton hierarchy (e.g., a character)."
msgstr "导出具有骨骼层级（例如角色）的资产。"

msgid "Combined Asset"
msgstr "组合资产"

msgid "Exports a composited scene of instanced assets, indexable for use in levels."
msgstr "导出实例化资产的合成场景，可用于关卡中索引使用。"

msgid "Exports this Collection as a full level scene."
msgstr "导出此集合为完整的场景。"

msgid "Exports objects as Godot MultiMesh instances."
msgstr "导出为 Godot MultiMesh 实例。"

msgid "The root node will be a simple Node3D. Used for general assets."
msgstr "根节点将是一个简单的 Node3D。适用于通用资产。"

msgid "The root node will be a Godot StaticBody3D. Used for static environment geometry."
msgstr "根节点将是一个 Godot StaticBody3D。用于静态环境几何体。"

msgid "The root node will be a Godot RigidBody3D. Used for dynamic physics objects."
msgstr "根节点将是一个 Godot RigidBody3D。用于动态物理对象。"

msgid "The root node will be a Godot VehicleBody3D. Used for raycast vehicle physics."
msgstr "根节点将是一个 Godot VehicleBody3D。用于射线车辆物理。"

msgid "The root node will be a Godot Area3D. Used for detection volumes/triggers."
msgstr "根节点将是一个 Godot Area3D。用于检测体积/触发器。"

msgid "The root node is an AnimatableBody3D."
msgstr "根节点是 AnimatableBody3D。"

msgid "The root node is a NavigationRegion3D."
msgstr "根节点是 NavigationRegion3D。"

msgid "Static"
msgstr "静态"

msgid "Body behaves like a StaticBody (doesn't move)."
msgstr "物体行为像 StaticBody（不移动）。"

msgid "Kinematic"
msgstr "运动学"

msgid "Body moves only by script/animation (pushing others)."
msgstr "仅通过脚本/动画移动（推挤其他物体）。"

msgid "Asset ID"
msgstr "资产 ID"

msgid "Internal unique ID used by Nexus to track this asset. Re-rolled automatically when the collection is renamed to avoid duplicate ids across .blend files."
msgstr "Nexus 用于跟踪该资产的内部唯一 ID。当集合重命名时会自动重新生成，以避免在不同 .blend 文件中出现重复的 ID。"

msgid "File Type"
msgstr "文件类型"

msgid "Root Type"
msgstr "根节点类型"

msgid ""
"Determines the class of the root node in Godot.\n"
"\n"
"• Node3D: Simple container.\n"
"• StaticBody3D: For non-moving geometry (walls, floors).\n"
"• RigidBody3D: For physics objects (crates, debris).\n"
"• CharacterBody3D: For player/NPCs."
msgstr ""
"确定 Godot 中根节点的类。\n"
"\n"
"• Node3D：简单的容器。\n"
"• StaticBody3D：用于非运动几何体（墙壁、地板）。\n"
"• RigidBody3D：用于物理对象（箱子、碎片）。\n"
"• CharacterBody3D：用于玩家/NPC。"

msgid "Script Path (res://)"
msgstr "脚本路径 (res://)"

msgid "Optional: Path to a Godot script (.gd or .cs) that will be attached to the root node upon import."
msgstr "可选：指向 Godot 脚本 (.gd 或 .cs) 的路径，导入时将附加到根节点。"

msgid "Godot Group Name"
msgstr "Godot 组名称"

msgid ""
"Automatically adds the imported root node to this Group in Godot.\n"
"Useful for finding objects via code (e.g. 'Interactables', 'Enemies')."
msgstr ""
"自动将导入的根节点添加到此组中（Godot）。\n"
"可用于通过代码查找对象（例如“可交互物体”、“敌人”）。"

msgid "Preferred Scene Style"
msgstr "首选场景样式"

msgid ""
"Which derived Godot scene to build and instance for this asset.\n"
"\n"
"• Wrapper: standalone baked scene (edits propagate to parents).\n"
"• Inherited: inherits the glTF (edits are local overrides).\n"
"• Disabled: no automatic derived scene is built."
msgstr ""
"为该资产构建和实例化的派生 Godot 场景。\n"
"\n"
"• Wrapper：独立的烘焙场景（编辑会传播到父级）。\n"
"• Inherited：继承 glTF（编辑是本地覆盖）。\n"
"• Disabled：不自动构建派生场景。"

msgid "Collision Layer Value"
msgstr "碰撞层值"

msgid "Bitmask: Defines on which layers this object exists (What am I?)."
msgstr "位掩码：定义该物体存在于哪些层级中（我是谁？）。"

msgid "Collision Mask Value"
msgstr "碰撞掩码值"

msgid "Bitmask: Defines which layers this object can detect or collide with (What do I touch?)."
msgstr "位掩码：定义该物体可以检测或与其发生碰撞的层级（我触碰什么？）。"

msgid "Sleep on Start"
msgstr "启动时休眠"

msgid "If enabled, the body will not move until a collision occurs."
msgstr "如果启用，则身体在发生碰撞前不会移动。"

msgid "Lock Rotation"
msgstr "锁定旋转"

msgid "If enabled, the body cannot rotate."
msgstr "如果启用，车身无法旋转。"

msgid "Freeze"
msgstr "冻结"

msgid "Puts the body in a frozen state (useful for suspended traps or lights)."
msgstr "将车身置于冻结状态（适用于悬停陷阱或灯光）。"

msgid "Freeze Mode"
msgstr "冻结模式"

msgid "Defines behavior when frozen."
msgstr "定义冻结时的行为。"

msgid "Brake"
msgstr "刹车"

msgid "Initial braking force applied to the vehicle on import (Godot VehicleBody3D.brake)."
msgstr "导入时施加到车辆上的初始制动力（Godot VehicleBody3D.brake）。"

msgid "Engine Force"
msgstr "引擎力"

msgid "Initial engine force applied to the vehicle on import (Godot VehicleBody3D.engine_force)."
msgstr "导入时施加到车辆上的初始引擎力（Godot VehicleBody3D.engine_force）。"

msgid "Steering (deg)"
msgstr "转向（度）"

msgid "Initial steering angle in degrees on import (stored as radians in export metadata)."
msgstr "导入时（以度为单位）的初始转向角度（导出元数据中存储为弧度）。"

msgid "Mass"
msgstr "质量"

msgid "Vehicle mass in kg on import (Godot VehicleBody3D.mass)."
msgstr "车辆质量（单位：千克）在导入时（Godot VehicleBody3D.mass）。"

msgid "Sync to Physics"
msgstr "同步到物理引擎"

msgid "Synchronizes movement to physics frame. Enable for moving platforms with player; disable for keyframe-accurate animation (doors, decorative)."
msgstr "与物理帧同步移动。为带有玩家的平台启用；为关键帧精确动画（门、装饰）禁用。"

msgid "Physics Material"
msgstr "物理材质"

msgid ""
"Path to a Godot PhysicsMaterial resource (.phymat or .tres).\n"
"\n"
"Defines physical surface properties like:\n"
"• Friction (Slippery vs. Rough)\n"
"• Bounce (Elasticity)\n"
"• Absorbent"
msgstr ""
"Godot 物理材质资源 (.phymat 或.tres) 的路径。\n"
"\n"
"定义物理表面属性，例如：\n"
"• 摩擦（光滑 vs. 粗糙）\n"
"• 回弹（弹性）\n"
"• 吸能"

msgid "Metadata"
msgstr "元数据"

msgid "Custom metadata for Godot nodes (node.set_meta). Types: float, int, bool, string, StringName."
msgstr "Godot 节点（node.set_meta）的自定义元数据。类型：float、int、bool、string、StringName。"

msgid "Export Animations"
msgstr "导出动画"

msgid "If enabled, NLA tracks on the armature/objects in this collection will be exported as AnimationPlayer tracks."
msgstr "如果启用，此集合中的骨骼/对象上的 NLA 轨道将导出为动画播放器轨道。"

msgid "Add to Asset Library"
msgstr "添加到资产库"

msgid "Registers this Collection as an Asset in Blender's internal Asset Browser."
msgstr "将此集合注册为 Blender 内部资产浏览器中的资产。"

msgid "Asset Catalog"
msgstr "资产目录"

msgid "Path in the Asset Browser (e.g., 'Props/Furniture'). Leave empty for root."
msgstr "在资产浏览器中的路径（例如 'Props/Furniture'）。留空表示根目录。"

msgid "Target Asset ID"
msgstr "目标资产 ID"

msgid "The Asset ID of the Skeletal/Asset Collection that this Animation Library targets."
msgstr "此动画库所针对的骨骼/资产集合的资产 ID。"

msgid "MultiMesh Analysis Cache"
msgstr "MultiMesh 分析缓存"

msgid "Stores the result of the last MultiMesh analysis as a JSON string for UI display."
msgstr "将上次 MultiMesh 分析的结果存储为 JSON 字符串，以便 UI 显示。"

msgid "MultiMesh Cache is Dirty"
msgstr "MultiMesh 缓存已修改"

msgid "True if the MultiMesh collection has changed since the last analysis (requires refresh)."
msgstr "如果多网格集合自上次分析以来已更改（需要刷新），则为真。"

msgid "Generate Collisions"
msgstr "生成碰撞体"

msgid "WARNING: High Performance Cost! Creates physics bodies for every instance. Use only for large obstacles (Rocks, Trees), NOT for grass."
